Package: dictacode-stt
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: dictacode-bootstrap
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-venv, alsa-utils, libportaudio2
Recommends: build-essential, cmake, git, portaudio19-dev
Maintainer: Christian Prior-Mamulyan <cprior@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/cprima-homelab/dictacode
Description: dictacode speech-to-text engine
 Provides the speech-to-text pipeline for dictacode.
 .
 This package:
  - Installs the STT pipeline scripts
  - Provides install-whisper.sh to build whisper.cpp
  - Configures systemd service for continuous transcription
  - Sends transcribed text to HID device via UART
 .
 After installation:
  1. Edit /etc/dictacode/stt.conf (optional)
  2. Run: sudo /opt/dictacode/stt/install-whisper.sh
  3. Start service: sudo systemctl start dictacode-stt
